  "question": "Find the equivalent capacitance, in $\\mu$F, of a $3\\ \\mu$F capacitor in series with a parallel combination of $2\\ \\mu$F and $4\\ \\mu$F.",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
