  "numerical_answer": "2",
  "tolerance": "0",
  "solution": "Parallel: $2 + 4 = 6\\ \\mu$F. Series with $3\\ \\mu$F: $\\dfrac{3 \\times 6}{9} = 2\\ \\mu$F.",
